Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: megatokyo-daemon
Architecture: any
Depends:
  ${shlibs:Depends},
  ${misc:Depends},
  systemd
Description: Megatokyo webcomic scraper and API daemon
 Scrapes megatokyo.com for chapters, strips and the author's rants (blog
 posts), caches them locally in SQLite, and serves them over a small HTTP
 API — for megatokyo-gui, or any other client, local or remote.
 .
 Also caches rant translations (DeepL) on first request per language.

Package: megatokyo-gui
Architecture: any
Depends:
  ${shlibs:Depends},
  ${misc:Depends},
  qml-qt6,
  qml6-module-qtcore,
  qml6-module-qtquick,
  qml6-module-qtquick-controls,
  qml6-module-qtquick-layouts
Recommends: megatokyo-daemon
Description: Megatokyo webcomic reader (QML client)
 A QML client for browsing the Megatokyo webcomic by chapter or strip,
 reading the author's rants with on-demand translation, and getting
 notified when a new strip or rant goes up.
 .
 Talks to a megatokyo-daemon instance, local (installed by the
 Recommends above and started automatically) or remote (configured in
 Settings).
